---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
---
<BaseLayout title="Lenovo Graphics Pad">
  <section>
    <h2>Welcome 👋</h2>
    <p class="lead"><strong>Lenovo Graphics Pad</strong> is an Android drawing and input diagnostics starter. Its drawing preview is local; USB and Bluetooth host transports are not implemented.</p>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>What's here</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Local pointer drawing preview</li>
        <li>Normalized coordinates and Flutter-reported pressure diagnostics</li>
        <li>Digitizer report payload encoder foundation</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Features</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Flutter 3.38.7 with Material Design 3</li>
        <li>USB and Bluetooth are selector options only; no device connection exists yet</li>
        <li>Pointer pressure is shown as reported by Flutter and may be synthetic or unavailable</li>
        <li>Android builds and signing setup are retained</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Download / Release</h3>
      <p class="lead">Get Android release artifacts from GitHub Releases.</p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/cmwen/lenovo-graphics-pad/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Check releases →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Quick start</h3>
      <p class="lead">Get started in minutes with Flutter.</p>
      <pre style="background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:8px;overflow:auto">git clone https://github.com/cmwen/lenovo-graphics-pad.git
cd lenovo-graphics-pad
flutter pub get
flutter run</pre>
      <p style="margin-top:8px"><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "")}/install/`} style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none">Open full install guide →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>Next steps</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Review <code>lib/pen_report.dart</code> for the local report encoding format</li>
        <li>Connect and validate a host transport before sending reports to hardware</li>
        <li>Configure <code>astro/astro.config.mjs</code> for your GitHub Pages URL</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
